  "queryText" : "PREFIX i: <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso15531#>\nPREFIX e: <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/iso14040#>\nPREFIX c: <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/core#>\nPREFIX a: <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/alignment#>\nPREFIX t: <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/research#>\nPREFIX p: <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/paint-ext#>\nPREFIX r: <http://w3id.org/protys/ontology/resource#>\nPREFIX f: <http://w3id.org/protys/fixture#>\nPREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>\nPREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>\n# Q16 Tiempo de uso y OEE registrado por recurso y plan\nSELECT ?plan ?resource (SUM(?duration) AS ?usedTimeMinutes) ?oeePercent\nWHERE { { SELECT DISTINCT ?plan ?operation ?resource ?duration WHERE {\n?lot t:hasPlan ?plan ; i:hasProcess ?process . ?plan a i:ProcessPlan ; i:includesActivity ?operation .\n?operation i:partOfProcess ?process ; i:usesResource ?resource ; i:duration ?duration . } }\nOPTIONAL { ?resource t:oeePercent ?oeePercent } } GROUP BY ?plan ?resource ?oeePercent ORDER BY ?plan ?resource\n",
